## Treasury

Current Treasury Size: ~1,300,000,000 ADA (estimated on-chain treasury balance as of 2024-12; fluctuates with each epoch)
Treasury Composition: 100% ADA (native protocol token); no stablecoins, no external assets held on-chain
Stablecoin Holdings: 0
Native Token Holdings: ADA only
Other Assets: Tidak ada aset non-ADA di treasury on-chain; Cardano Foundation, IOG, Emurgo masing-masing mengelola treasury korporat terpisah (fiat, ADA, dll) yang tidak transparan on-chain
Treasury Custodian: On-chain treasury dikendalikan oleh protokol melalui CIP-1694 governance actions; Constitutional Committee (Interim CC) memvalidasi withdrawal; DReps dan SPO voting menentukan alokasi
Sources: (HIGH) [CIP-1694 Treasury Governance, https://cips.cardano.org/cips/cip1694/]; (HIGH) [Cardano Governance Portal Treasury, https://gov.cardano.org/]; (MEDIUM) [Cardano Foundation Annual Report 2023 Treasury Disclosure, https://cardanofoundation.org/annual-report-2023/]

## Revenue Model

Revenue Stream: Transaction Fees (Protocol Level)
Status: Live
Description: Setiap transaksi memerlukan fee minimal (a * size + b * execution units); fee dikumpulkan per epoch dan dibagi: sebagian ke stake pool operators (reward), sebagian masuk ke protocol treasury
Sources: (HIGH) [Cardano Network Parameters Fees, https://docs.cardano.org/operating-a-stake-pool/network-parameters/]; (HIGH) [IOG Blog Shelley Incentives, https://iohk.io/en/blog/posts/2020/07/29/shelley-incentives/]

Revenue Stream: Monetary Expansion (Inflationary Rewards)
Status: Live
Description: Protokol mencetak ADA baru setiap epoch sesuai jadwal monoton menurun (ekspansi ~0.3% per epoch awal, menurun seiring waktu); dana ini mendanai staking rewards bersama fee transaksi
Sources: (HIGH) [Cardano Monetary Policy, https://docs.cardano.org/cardano-components/cardano-token/monetary-policy/]; (HIGH) [IOG Research Monetary Policy, https://iohk.io/en/research/library/]

Revenue Stream: IOG Commercial Revenue (Enterprise Contracts, Atala PRISM, Consulting)
Status: Live
Description: IOG (perusahaan untuk-laba) menghasilkan pendapatan dari kontrak enterprise (Atala PRISM deployments untuk pemerintah), konsultansi blockchain, dan pengembangan custom solution; tidak berasal dari protokol Cardano langsung
Sources: (MEDIUM) [IOG About Services, https://inputoutput.io/services/]; (MEDIUM) [Atala PRISM Case Studies, https://atalaprism.io/case-studies/]

Revenue Stream: Emurgo Venture Revenue (Investments, Yoroi Wallet Partnerships, Accelerator)
Status: Live
Description: Emurgo mengelola venture fund, investasi ekosistem, dan monetisasi Yoroi wallet (partnership, affiliate); pendapatan komersial terpisah dari protokol
Sources: (MEDIUM) [Emurgo Ventures, https://emurgo.io/ventures/]; (MEDIUM) [Emurgo Annual Report 2023, https://emurgo.io/annual-report-2023/]

Revenue Stream: Cardano Foundation Operational Grants & Donations
Status: Live
Description: Yayasan nirlaba menerima grant, donasi, dan sponsorship untuk operasional standarisasi, edukasi, dan pertumbuhan ekosistem; tidak ada fee protokol yang mengalir ke Foundation
Sources: (MEDIUM) [Cardano Foundation Annual Report 2023 Funding, https://cardanofoundation.org/annual-report-2023/]

Revenue Stream: Project Catalyst Treasury Returns (Recycling)
Status: Live
Description: Beberapa proyek yang didanai Catalyst mengembalikan keuntungan/token ke treasury melalui proposal "treasury return" atau buyback; bukan revenue stream terjamin
Sources: (MEDIUM) [Project Catalyst Treasury Return Proposals, https://cardano.ideascale.com/c/idea/409211]

## Revenue History

Tidak diungkap.
Sources: (HIGH) [Cardano Foundation Annual Reports (no protocol revenue breakdown), https://cardanofoundation.org/annual-reports/]; (HIGH) [IOG Financials (private company, not disclosed), https://inputoutput.io/]; (HIGH) [Emurgo Financials (private company, not disclosed), https://emurgo.io/]

Catatan: Protokol Cardano tidak memiliki "revenue" tradisional; fee transaksi dan ekspansi monetary mengalir ke stake pool rewards dan treasury on-chain, bukan ke entitas sentral. Entitas terpisah (IOG, Emurgo, CF) tidak mempublikasikan laporan keuangan teraudit.

## Fundraising Mechanism

Mechanism: Public Voucher Sale (2015-2017)
Description: Penjualan voucher ADA melalui Attain Alternative Strategies Ltd (entitas Swiss) ke peserta pasar Asia (utamanya Jepang) selama ~16 bulan; dana dikumpulkan dalam BTC dan JPY
Sources: (HIGH) [Messari Cardano Launch and Token Distribution, https://messari.io/report/cardano-launch-and-token-distribution]

Mechanism: Genesis Allocation (Protocol Bootstrap)
Description: Pada mainnet launch, supply genesis dialokasikan ke tiga entitas pendiri (IOG, Emurgo, Cardano Foundation) dan voucher holder; tidak ada VC/private sale terpisah
Sources: (HIGH) [Messari Cardano Launch and Token Distribution, https://messari.io/report/cardano-launch-and-token-distribution]

Mechanism: On-Chain Treasury (Protocol-Native Funding)
Description: Mulai era Shelley (2020), protokol mengumpulkan fee + monetary expansion ke treasury on-chain; didistribusikan via Project Catalyst (community voting) dan CIP-1694 governance actions
Sources: (HIGH) [CIP-1694 Treasury, https://cips.cardano.org/cips/cip1694/]; (HIGH) [Project Catalyst, https://cardano.ideascale.com/]

Mechanism: Enterprise Revenue (IOG/Emurgo Commercial Arms)
Description: IOG dan Emurgo sebagai perusahaan komersial mengumpulkan pendapatan dari kontrak enterprise, venture investment, dan layanan profesional; independen dari mekanisme protokol
Sources: (MEDIUM) [IOG Services, https://inputoutput.io/services/]; (MEDIUM) [Emurgo Ventures, https://emurgo.io/ventures/]

## Token Sale

Sale Name: ADA Voucher Sale
Date: 2015-09 to 2017-01
Status: Completed
Type: Public Sale (voucher-based, conducted by Swiss entity Attain Alternative Strategies Ltd)
Amount Raised: ~$62,000,000 USD equivalent
Tokens Sold: ~25,900,000,000 ADA
Price: ~$0.0024 per ADA (varied by tranche and currency BTC/JPY)
Jurisdiction: Swiss (entity), Japan (primary marketing)
Regulatory Framework: Swiss financial regulations (voucher model, not token sale at time of purchase)
Sources: (HIGH) [Messari Cardano Launch and Token Distribution, https://messari.io/report/cardano-launch-and-token-distribution]; (HIGH) [Cardano Roadmap Byron, https://roadmap.cardano.org/en/byron/]

Catatan: Tidak ada private sale, strategic sale, Series A/B, launchpad, auction, atau community sale terpisah selain voucher sale di atas. Distribusi token ke tim/foundation via genesis allocation, bukan token sale.

## Financial Dependencies

Dependency: Genesis Allocation to Founding Entities (IOG, Emurgo, Cardano Foundation)
Description: Tiga entitas utama menerima alokasi ADA besar pada genesis (total ~5.18B ADA) sebagai dana operasional jangka panjang; IOG dan Emurgo menjual sebagian untuk operasional
Sources: (HIGH) [Messari Cardano Launch and Token Distribution, https://messari.io/report/cardano-launch-and-token-distribution]

Dependency: On-Chain Protocol Treasury
Description: Treasury on-chain (dana protokol dari fee + ekspansi monetary) mendanai pengembangan ekosistem via Project Catalyst dan governance actions CIP-1694; menjadi sumber dana utama untuk public goods
Sources: (HIGH) [CIP-1694 Treasury Governance, https://cips.cardano.org/cips/cip1694/]; (HIGH) [Project Catalyst, https://cardano.ideascale.com/]

Dependency: IOG Commercial Contracts (Enterprise/Government)
Description: IOG bergantung pada kontrak enterprise (Atala PRISM, national ID projects) untuk pendapatan komersial terpisah dari treasury protokol
Sources: (MEDIUM) [IOG Services, https://inputoutput.io/services/]; (MEDIUM) [Atala PRISM Ethiopia Case Study, https://atalaprism.io/case-studies/ethiopia/]

Dependency: Emurgo Venture Portfolio Returns
Description: Emurgo bergantung pada exit/return dari investasi venture fund dan revenue Yoroi wallet untuk operasional komersial
Sources: (MEDIUM) [Emurgo Ventures Portfolio, https://emurgo.io/ventures/]; (MEDIUM) [Emurgo Annual Report 2023, https://emurgo.io/annual-report-2023/]

Dependency: Cardano Foundation Grants & Sponsorships
Description: Foundation sebagai yayasan nirlaba bergantung pada grant, donasi, sponsorship untuk operasional standarisasi dan edukasi
Sources: (MEDIUM) [Cardano Foundation Annual Report 2023 Funding Sources, https://cardanofoundation.org/annual-report-2023/]

## Financial Risk

Risk: Treasury Concentration in ADA (Single Asset Exposure)
Description: Treasury on-chain 100% ADA; volatilitas harga ADA langsung mempengaruhi daya beli treasury untuk mendanai pengembangan (diakui dalam laporan Cardano Foundation dan diskusi governance)
Sources: (HIGH) [Cardano Foundation Annual Report 2023 Risk Disclosure, https://cardanofoundation.org/annual-report-2023/]; (HIGH) [CIP-1694 Governance Discussions Treasury Diversification, https://cardano.ideascale.com/c/idea/409211]

Risk: Genesis Entity Sell Pressure (IOG/Emurgo/CF Operational Sales)
Description: Entitas pendiri secara berkala menjual ADA dari alokasi genesis untuk operasional; menciptakan tekanan jual berkelanjutan yang diketahui pasar (on-chain analytics tracking genesis wallet outflows)
Sources: (HIGH) [AdaStat Genesis Wallet Tracking, https://adastat.net/]; (MEDIUM) [Cardano Foundation Transparency Report Sales Disclosure, https://cardanofoundation.org/transparency/]

Risk: Protocol Revenue Dependency on Transaction Volume
Description: Fee transaksi (bagian masuk treasury) bergantung pada aktivitas on-chain; bear market menurunkan volume → menurunkan fee → memperlambat pertumbuhan treasury
Sources: (HIGH) [Cardano Network Parameters Fee Mechanism, https://docs.cardano.org/operating-a-stake-pool/network-parameters/]; (MEDIUM) [DefiLlama Cardano Fees Historical, https://defillama.com/chain/Cardano]

Risk: Monetary Expansion Schedule Fixed (Cannot Adjust to Treasury Needs)
Description: Jadwal ekspansi monetary (inflation) hardcoded dan menurun monotonic; tidak dapat dipercepat untuk mendanai treasury tanpa hard fork governance (CIP-1694 process)
Sources: (HIGH) [Cardano Monetary Policy, https://docs.cardano.org/cardano-components/cardano-token/monetary-policy/]; (HIGH) [CIP-1694 Parameter Change Governance Action, https://cips.cardano.org/cips/cip1694/]

Risk: No Audited Consolidated Financial Statements for Core Entities
Description: IOG, Emurgo, Cardano Foundation tidak mempublikasikan laporan keuangan teraudit konsolidasi; transparansi keuangan terbatas pada annual report narrative dan on-chain treasury data
Sources: (HIGH) [Cardano Foundation Annual Report 2023 (narrative only), https://cardanofoundation.org/annual-report-2023/]; (MEDIUM) [IOG No Public Financial Statements, https://inputoutput.io/]; (MEDIUM) [Emurgo No Public Financial Statements, https://emurgo.io/]

Risk: Regulatory Uncertainty on Treasury Governance (CIP-1694)
Description: Tata kelola treasury on-chain via DRep/CC/SPO voting belum diuji hukum di yurisdiksi manapun; risiko regulasi future pada DAO treasury management
Sources: (MEDIUM) [CIP-1694 Governance Framework, https://cips.cardano.org/cips/cip1694/]; (LOW) [Cardano Foundation Legal Disclaimer, https://cardanofoundation.org/legal/]

